{{TAG:0003:001D:}}Thank you!{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}} Thank {{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}you!{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0000:}}Dr. Shrunk is in the house!{{TAG:0007:0009:2D000000}}{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0003:}}My {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}Curiosity Joke{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}} is just the
thing to CURE what ails you!{{TAG:0007:0009:64000000}}{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:001B:}}Have I ever got a serious case of
