something my kid said last night!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}So{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}} he hears a knock, right?{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}} And he
goes to the door and shouts,{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}}{{TAG:0003:0026:}}{{TAG:000D:0004:01CD}} "Who
