{{TAG:0003:0001:}}And what does HE say?{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Get this!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}
{{TAG:0007:000B:}}{{TAG:000D:0002:00CD}}{{TAG:000D:0004:02CD}}{{TAG:0003:001F:}}"My MOM is out right now!"{{TAG:000D:0005:}}

{{TAG:0003:000A:}}My own kid says that! {{TAG:0007:000D:}}{{TAG:0007:0000:2D000000}}{{TAG:0003:0017:}}Can you
